  "_about": [
    "The licence terms of every dataset that ships in the installer (BIZ-34), keyed",
    "by its docs/data-register.csv id. The register's 'licence' column says it in",
    "words; this file says it in terms a test can check: SPDX ids, or the",
    "LicenseRef- names defined in data-allowed.txt. A row whose parts come from",
    "several places lists every term. backend/tests/test_data_register.py fails",
    "when a shipped row has no entry here, or a term that data-allowed.txt does not",
    "list. 'LicenseRef-Unknown' (provenance not recorded) passes only while the",
    "row is cleared = pending, and is listed as a warning; the owner's sign-off",
    "replaces it with the real term."
